    "answer": {
      "short": "$11.5\\text{ cm}$",
      "worked": "Circle:\n$$\\begin{align*}A &= \\pi r^2\\\\A &= \\pi(6.5)^2\\end{align*}$$\nSquare:\n$$\\begin{align*}A &= l^2\\\\l^2 &= \\pi(6.5)^2\\\\l &= \\sqrt{\\pi(6.5)^2}\\\\l &\\approx 11.5\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
